{"sections":[{"slug":"椭圆复形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"椭圆复形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆复形</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“椭圆复形”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于微分算子的正合列</span>\n$$\r\n\\cdots \\to \\Gamma(E_{k+1}) \\overset{D_k}{\\to} \\Gamma(E_{k}) \\to \\cdots\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">若其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/象征","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">象征</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">构成的复形</span>\n$$\r\n\\cdots \\to \\pi^*E_{k+1} \\overset{\\sigma(D_k)}{\\to} \\pi^* E_k \\to\\cdots\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为正合列</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $(E_\\bullet,D_\\bullet)$ <span lang=\"zh\">椭圆复形</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">紧流形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> de Rham <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span> $(\\Omega^\\bullet(X),d)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是椭圆复形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/解析指标","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">解析指标</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等于</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Euler示性数","text":"Euler <span lang=\"zh\">示性数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}